    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON BUSINESS AND MANAGEMENT(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的設計主要是開放給已修畢基礎管理類學分的經營管理碩專班的同學修習，本課程設計是結合理論架構與實務經驗，相關的研究主題也是課堂討論重點。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a class designed for those EMBA students who already took the fundamental management courses and pursing a capstone course that can consolidate those learned theories/ framework and practical experiences. An industrial focus thesis is designed output for this class. A relevant field research topics and theories will be discussed in the class.",
